From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: austxu <austxu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 17:42:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] vulkan: fuse Q4_0 RMSNorm activation on Navi22

Extend the opt-in direct RMSNorm+MUL Q8_1 sidecar to the stock Q4_0 MMVQ consumer, keep conflicting routing overrides fail-closed, and expose per-format coverage counters. Add whole-graph CPU-reference coverage for Llama 2 shapes, boundaries, residual partials, cache reuse, and fallbacks.

Assisted-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp | 60 +++++++++++++++++++---
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp           | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

